gt;he&amp;#39;s&lt;/i&gt; the better suspect, one supposes. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5989533660725900526/comments/default/4793988802944217189'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5989533660725900526/comments/default/4793988802944217189'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/make-this-right-jared-help-free-chris.html?showComment=1473885895212#c4793988802944217189' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='//3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/make-this-right-jared-help-free-chris.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5989533660725900526' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/5989533660725900526' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 14, 2016 at 2:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1270099901002354397</id><published>2016-09-14T14:18:01.266-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-14T14:18:01.266-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Has the DNA ever been tested to see if it belongs ...</title><content type='html'>Has the DNA ever been tested to see if it belongs to Jeffery Smith?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5989533660725900526/comments/default/1270099901002354397'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/5989533660725